":524,"outcome":"The Fufuluo broke away in 487 and held Dzungaria against repeated Rouran attacks (508, 516, 520); they penetrated Rouran land in 521-524 but were repulsed.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaoche"},{"name":"Göktürk revolt against the Rouran","from":546,"to":555,"outcome":"Bumin crushed a Tiele revolt (546 or 551) and then broke with the Rouran; he beat Anagui in 552, the Turks occupied the Rouran in 555 and the khaganate was annihilated.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rouran_Khaganate"}],"certainty":[{"from":402,"to":555,"level":"soft","note":"Steppe frontiers throughout; no treaty line is dated by the pages."}],"sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rouran_Khaganate","title":"Rouran Khaganate"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emperor_Taiwu_of_Northern_Wei","title":"Emperor Taiwu of Northern Wei"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaoche","title":"Gaoche"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/First_Turkic_Khaganate","title":"First Turkic Khaganate"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hephthalites","title":"Hephthalites"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaochang","title":"Gaochang"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yujiul%C3%BC_Anagui","title":"Yujiulü Anagui"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yujiul%C3%BC_Datan","title":"Yujiulü Datan"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kumo_Xi","title":"Kumo Xi"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mumocheng","title":"Mumocheng"}]}